Description: Querencia Desktop program icons (alpha)
 Own program icons of Querencia Desktop, a classic desktop in the style of
 GNOME 2, for the hicolor icon theme: Bilder, Editor, Einstellungen,
 Lautstärke, Sitzung and Systemmonitor, each as SVG and as PNG in 16, 22,
 24, 32, 64, 128 and 256 pixels.
 .
 There is deliberately no 48x48 PNG next to the SVG: GTK 4.22 frees the
 window icon buffer twice for such icons and crashes when a window closes.
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
